<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 2.5 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 2.5 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Consumer Price Index (CPI) for May rose 2.5 percent from the same month a year ago, the Statistics Department said on Saturday.</p>
<p>In March, the CPI grew 3.2 percent year-on-year.  </p>
<p> CONSUMER PRICE INDEX	May 97    April 97  May 96</p>
<p> Change year/year pct	2.5	 2.6	 3.6</p>
<p> Index (base year 1994)    109.6     109.1     106.9</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
